# Cursor Cloud Extra High

Use MCP `cloud_launch`, `cloud_list`, `cloud_status`, and `cloud_result` (or `scripts/launch-cloud-extra-high.sh`). Set `GCS_CLOUD_REPO` or `CLOUD_REPO_URL` before create. Do not print API keys. After `CLOUD_LAUNCH_OK`, a waiter A2A-pings the owning seat; do not block the Director turn on watch.

`cloud_list` prints latest-run `runStatus` (`RUNNING` vs `FINISHED`), not only agent `ACTIVE`. ACTIVE+FINISHED leftovers are not live workers.
